<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Basic H1 net higher at 71 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Basic H1 net higher at 71 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			     (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues		    124.49 vs 10.117</p>
<p>    Net income		   71.01 vs 0.751</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Basic Consolidated Inc, formerly Basic Petroleum &amp; Minerals Inc. The company is engaged in oil and gas exploration, petrochemicals, gaming and leisure businesses.</p>
